{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "地前漸伏。初地已上頓伏。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "金剛無間道斷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "地地漸斷。無間道永斷義也。解脫道斷正義也。"}
